{"words": [{"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "translation": "believed"}, {"text": "وَٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "and those who"}, {"text": "هَادُوا۟", "translation": "became Jews"}, {"text": "وَٱلنَّصَـٰرَىٰ", "translation": "and the Christians"}, {"text": "وَٱلصَّـٰبِـِٔينَ", "translation": "and the Sabians "}, {"text": "مَنْ", "translation": "who"}, {"text": "ءَامَنَ", "translation": "believed"}, {"text": "بِٱللَّهِ", "translation": "in Allah"}, {"text": "وَٱلْيَوْمِ", "translation": "and the Day"}, {"text": "ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ", "translation": "[the] Last"}, {"text": "وَعَمِلَ", "translation": "and did"}, {"text": "صَـٰلِحًۭا", "translation": "righteous deeds"}, {"text": "فَلَهُمْ", "translation": "so for them"}, {"text": "أَجْرُهُمْ", "translation": "their reward"}, {"text": "عِندَ", "translation": "(is) with"}, {"text": "رَبِّهِمْ", "translation": "their Lord"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "and no"}, {"text": "خَوْفٌ", "translation": "fear"}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِمْ", "translation": "on them"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "هُمْ", "translation": "they"}, {"text": "يَحْزَنُونَ", "translation": "will grieve"}], "sahih": "Indeed, those who believed and those who were Jews or Christians or Sabeans [before Prophet Muḥammad (ﷺ)] - those [among them] who believed in Allāh and the Last Day and did righteousness - will have their reward with their Lord, and no fear will there be concerning them, nor will they grieve1."}